# Nextech

> Nextech provides cloud-based, specialty-specific EHR and practice management software for ophthalmology, dermatology, plastic surgery, orthopedic, and med spa/aesthetic practices, connecting clinical, operational, and financial workflows on one platform.

Nextech describes its mission as delivering "intelligent, connected solutions that streamline workflows, strengthen financial performance, and elevate the patient experience in specialty practices." The company is headquartered at 4221 W Boy Scout Blvd, Suite 350, Tampa, FL 33607, and states it serves 16K+ physicians, 5,500+ practices, and 60K+ staff members. Nextech has grown in part through acquisitions of specialty-focused vendors, including SRS Health (orthopedic EMR), SupraMed, TouchMD, and MyMedLeads (patient lead/communication software, now the basis of Nextech CRM).

This file indexes nextech.com's evergreen product, solution, specialty, company, legal, and compliance pages. It intentionally omits the site's large content archive (blog, press releases, industry news, guest-author bios — roughly 700 individual URLs); see the "Content archive" note at the end for how to reach that material.

## Products

- [EHR](https://www.nextech.com/products/ehr): Specialty-specific electronic health records software.
- [Practice Management](https://www.nextech.com/products/practice-management): Scheduling, billing, and reporting for specialty practices.
- [Cora](https://www.nextech.com/products/cora): "Cora Scribe" — a two-way AI scribe that builds structured clinical documentation in real time during the patient encounter (ophthalmology-focused).
- [Payments](https://www.nextech.com/products/payments): Embedded payment processing for specialty practices.
- [RCM Services](https://www.nextech.com/products/rcm-services): Outsourced revenue cycle management (billing/collections) services.
- [CRM](https://www.nextech.com/products/crm): Patient relationship management and lead/communication software (built on the acquired MyMedLeads platform).
- [TouchMD](https://www.nextech.com/products/touchmd): Visual consultation and patient-education/photo software, mainly for aesthetic and plastic surgery practices.
- [Consulting](https://www.nextech.com/products/consulting): Practice optimization and compliance advisory services.

## Solutions

- [Clinical Workflows](https://www.nextech.com/solutions/clinical-workflows): Streamlines clinical workflows so providers can "focus on care, not clicks."
- [AI](https://www.nextech.com/solutions/ai): Embeds AI across specialty workflows to cut admin burden and protect margins ("AI that works the way your practice does").
- [Advanced Analytics](https://www.nextech.com/solutions/advanced-analytics): Turns practice data into actionable insights ("Turn practice data into clear, confident decisions").
- [Patient Experience](https://www.nextech.com/solutions/patient-experience): Connects and personalizes patient interactions at every touchpoint.
- [Payment Solutions](https://www.nextech.com/solutions/payment-solutions): Embedded payment processing to collect and reconcile ("A better way to collect, reconcile, and grow").
- [Revenue Cycle Management (RCM)](https://www.nextech.com/solutions/rcm): Reduces revenue leakage and improves collections ("Turn financial performance into practice growth").
- [Practice Management](https://www.nextech.com/solutions/practice-management): Simplifies admin work and connects teams ("Keep your practice running at its best").

## Specialties

- [Ophthalmology](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/ophthalmology): Connected EHR, practice management, CRM, and RCM tools built for eyecare practices.
  - [Ophthalmology EHR Software](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/ophthalmology/ehr-software): IntelleChartPRO — "ophthalmology EHR designed by and for eyecare professionals."
  - [Ophthalmology Payment Software](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/ophthalmology/payment-software): Embedded payments built to "collect faster without slowing operations."
- [Dermatology](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/dermatology): A connected platform for medical, cosmetic, and Mohs dermatology practices.
  - [Dermatology EHR Software](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/dermatology/ehr-software): "EHR technology engineered for how dermatologists work."
- [Plastic Surgery](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/plastic-surgery): A connected platform spanning first consultation through long-term patient loyalty.
  - [Plastic Surgery EHR Software](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/plastic-surgery/ehr-software): "EHR technology created for the art and precision of plastic surgery."
- [Orthopedic](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/orthopedic): Technology built to improve efficiency and drive growth for orthopedic practices.
  - [Orthopedic EHR Software](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/orthopedic/ehr-software): SRSPro — orthopedic-specific EHR for documentation, imaging, prescribing, and compliance.
- [Med Spa](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/med-spa): A connected platform to streamline operations and "deliver the experience your brand promises."
  - [Med Spa EHR Software](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/med-spa/ehr-software): Cosmetic charting software with integrated photo management for aesthetic practices.
- [Aesthetic Payments Software](https://www.nextech.com/specialties/aesthetic/payments-software): Embedded payments built to boost treatment acceptance ("Payments that help clients say yes to more").

